  "why": [
   "EXT-1 drop_recommend by F: Option-pair tell. The x^2 coefficient c = 9 + 8 + ab is read straight off the product without solving anything; the option 7 is literally ab, and 24 = 7 + (8 + 9) (sum of two printed constants), with 10 = 17 - 7 corroborating 7 as the ab value. A student who writes c = 17 + ab and sees 7 can pick 24 without using the x-coefficient 65 at all (the decision step). Repair: remove ab as an option or change the 10/25 pair so 7 is not marked."
